<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Biodata Darra Anugrah</title>

    <style>
        /* =========================
           RESET
        ========================= */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16001f, #4b1768, #8e44ad);
            color: white;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* =========================
           BACKGROUND DECORATION
        ========================= */
        .circle {
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(5px);
            opacity: 0.25;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .circle-1 {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            background: #d98cff;
            top: -80px;
            left: -80px;
        }

        .circle-2 {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: #ff7ce5;
            right: -100px;
            bottom: -100px;
        }

        /* =========================
           NAVBAR
        ========================= */
        nav {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(20, 0, 30, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #e6b3ff;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: white;
        }

        nav button {
            border: none;
            background: #9b59b6;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            background: #b96ee0;
        }

        /* =========================
           HERO
        ========================= */
        .hero {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 850px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeUp 1s ease;
        }

        .profile-photo {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            margin: auto;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c77dff, #7b2cbf);
            border: 5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(218, 145, 255, 0.5);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 75px);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #dda0ff;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #eadcf0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 9px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            margin: 5px;
        }

        /* =========================
           BIODATA
        ========================= */
        .biodata {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #dcc9e4;
        }

        .biodata-grid {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .info-card {
            padding: 22px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .info-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .info-card .label {
            display: block;
            color: #dca8ff;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }

        .info-card .value {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* =========================
           TENTANG SAYA
        ========================= */
        .about {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-box {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .about-box .emoji {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-box p {
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #eee;
        }

        /* =========================
           MOTTO
        ========================= */
        .motto {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .motto-box {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                rgba(155,89,182,0.5),
                rgba(92,38,115,0.5)
            );
        }

        .motto-box h2 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .motto-box blockquote {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-style: italic;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #f0d8ff;
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================= */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            color: #d9c6df;
        }

        /* =========================
           ANIMATION
        ========================= */
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .hidden {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: 0.8s ease;
        }

        .show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* =========================
           RESPONSIVE
        ========================= */
        @media (max-width: 650px) {

            nav {
                padding: 16px 5%;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 80vh;
            }

            .biodata-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .profile-photo {
                width: 125px;
                height: 125px;
                font-size: 50px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .motto-box blockquote {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Background -->
    <div class="circle circle-1"></div>
    <div class="circle circle-2"></div>

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">
            Darra<span>.</span>
        </div>

        <button onclick="scrollToBiodata()">
            Lihat Biodata
        </button>
    </nav>


    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <div class="profile-photo">
                👩🏻
            </div>

            <h1>
                Halo, Saya <span>Darra</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                Selamat datang di website profil pribadi saya!
            </p>

            <div>
                <span class="tag">10G</span>
                <span class="tag">SMAN 19 Bandung</span>
                <span class="tag">Future Chef 👩🏻‍🍳</span>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Biodata -->
    <section class="biodata" id="biodata">

        <div class="section-title hidden">
            <h2>Biodata Saya</h2>
            <p>Kenali saya lebih dekat</p>
        </div>


        <div class="biodata-grid">

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Nama</span>
                <span class="value">Darra Anugrah</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Nama Panggilan</span>
                <span class="value">Darra</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Tempat, Tanggal Lahir</span>
                <span class="value">Tasikmalaya, 01 Maret 2011</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Kelas</span>
                <span class="value">10G</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Sekolah</span>
                <span class="value">SMAN 19 Bandung</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Hobi</span>
                <span class="value">Memasak 🍳</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Cita-cita</span>
                <span class="value">Menjadi Chef 👩🏻‍🍳</span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card hidden">
                <span class="label">Warna Favorit</span>
                <span class="value">Ungu 💜</span>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Tentang Saya -->
    <section class="about">

        <div class="section-title hidden">
            <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-box hidden">

            <div class="emoji">
                🍜
            </div>

            <p>
                Hai! Nama saya Darra. Saya adalah siswi kelas 10G
                di SMAN 19 Bandung. Saya mempunyai hobi memasak
                dan bercita-cita menjadi seorang chef.
                Selain itu, saya juga suka mie! 🍜
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Motto -->
    <section class="motto">

        <div class="motto-box hidden">

            <h2>✨ Motto Saya ✨</h2>

            <blockquote>
                “Belajar hari ini, sukses hari esok.”
            </blockquote>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>
            © <span id="year"></span> Darra Anugrah
        </p>
        <p>
            Dibuat dengan 💜
        </p>
    </footer>


    <!-- JavaScript -->
    <script>

        // Tombol "Lihat Biodata"
        function scrollToBiodata() {
            document.getElementById("biodata").scrollIntoView({
                behavior: "smooth"
            });
        }


        // Tahun otomatis
        document.getElementById("year").textContent =
            new Date().getFullYear();


        // Animasi saat elemen masuk layar
        const hiddenElements =
            document.querySelectorAll(".hidden");

        const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
            (entries) => {

                entries.forEach((entry) => {

                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                        entry.target.classList.add("show");
                    }

                });

            },
            {
                threshold: 0.15
            }
        );


        hiddenElements.forEach((element) => {
            observer.observe(element);
        });

    </script>

</body>
</html>
